<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>jQuery Hide Toggle</title>
</head>

<body>

    <p id="first">
        Lorem, ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Cumque, itaque.
        Voluptatem, nobis, perferendis quaerat sit in, earum nihil maxime sed nam
        quo necessitatibus sunt atque omnis soluta dignissimos error ratione.
    </p>

    <p id="second">
        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Dolor veritatis
        voluptatibus quibusdam saepe rem et molestiae nobis nihil dignissimos totam
        quidem cum omnis, perferendis minima quas culpa alias obcaecati quo.
    </p>

    <button id="btn">Alert</button>
    <button id="hide">Hide</button>
    <button id="toggle">Toggle</button>

    <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.7.1.slim.js"
        integrity="sha256-UgvvN8vBkgO0luPSUl2s8TIlOSYRoGFAX4jlCIm9Adc="
        crossorigin="anonymous"></script>

    <script>

        $("#btn").click(function () {
            alert("hello");
        });

        $("#hide").click(function () {
            $("#first").hide();
        });

        $("#toggle").click(function () {
            $("#first").toggle();
        });

    </script>

</body>
</html>
